# Shared types

Target packages under `org.devbot.bookmymovie.shared` (add classes when needed; `api/` prefixes already exist):

```text
api/          AppApi, WebApi, ApiPaths
exception/    GlobalExceptionHandler, ResourceNotFoundException
response/     ApiResponse, ErrorResponse
pagination/   PageResponse
validation/   reusable constraints
```

```java
// GOOD — envelope used by every controller
package org.devbot.bookmymovie.shared.response;
public record ApiResponse<T>(T data) {}

// BAD — movie DTO in shared
package org.devbot.bookmymovie.shared.response;
public record MovieSummaryResponse(Long id, String title) {}
```

Keep out of `shared`: feature `@RestController`s, `@Entity`, `SecurityFilterChain`, `BaseEntity` / `RedisConfig` (`core`), Flyway (`app`).
